I'm reporting one root cause: ts-price-service's database calls slowed sharply, and the failure spread up the call chain to ui-dashboard. Three things I checked were ruled out. Mysql's own CPU stayed low, so the fault is not in mysql. There are no restarts or uptime resets on the path. The travel-service→rabbitmq drops appear in the abnormal window, but no user-path span or error log shows an effect, so I left them out.

